  "id": "revolving-door-phenomenon",
  "term": "revolving-door phenomenon",
  "definition": "The revolving-door phenomenon is a pattern of repeated rehospitalization among people with severe mental illness. In this source, it is linked to missed follow-up visits and the absence of active follow-up after discharge.",
